  "description": "The exact original adult female goblin villager: slender upright build, olive green face and hands, pointed ears, narrow long nose and stern face. Dark near-black hair tied in high short ponytail by vivid red ribbon with long pointed tails. Purple fitted sleeveless short vest with white trim and small brass buttons, white long blouse sleeves with open hanging cuffs and fine dark lacing, white waist sash wrapped around midriff and tied at side. Purple close-fitting knee-length trousers with pale crisscross lacing along outer legs. Brown tall leather boots with brass eyelets and laces, pale cuffs. Her right hand carries the native small farm sickle: short dark handle and one slim curved crescent silver blade; preserve its exact native angle and visibility. It can be occluded behind her body or sleeve in rear poses. No extra tools. Preserve native layered clothing and exact coverage and proportions. Purple cloth and hair recolor independently; skin, white blouse and sash, red ribbon and brown boots are protected. No additional weapon, armor or ornaments.",
